                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='12'>The calculation for the chart below are as follow:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='12'>- For &quot;Read&quot;: The metrics is calculated from the date when the vendors  read the message. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='12'>i.e.a vendor has  2.0% fail-rate on date A and 3.0% on date B, and this vendor read the message on date B. The vendor is considered as &quot;Read&quot; and its Fail-rate calculated only on date B.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='12'>- For &quot;Not Read&quot;: The metrics is calculated when the message is received by the vendors. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='12'>- For &quot;All&quot;: The overall metrics that the vendors perform on the date of the orders were made. </run>
              </formatted-text>
